>>
endobj
2531 0 obj
<<
/Title (Why it is hidden: the typing error raises UnboundLocalError, a subclass of NameError and therefore of Exception. The broad handler catches it on every P line, pass discards it, and the loop carries on, so the program finishes normally with plausible but wrong numbers. That is worse than a crash because nobody knows to look for the fault.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2506 0 R
/Prev 2530 0 R
>>
